\f1\b0  The network that exists outside your home. The 
\f0\b Internet
\f1\b0  is essentially a massive WAN consisting of thousands of routers connected globally .{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S7MNX_UD7vY&t=101"}}{\fldrslt \uc0\u8232 }}\
