\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 What is the CCNA?\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 The 
\f0\b Cisco Certified Network Associate (CCNA)
\f1\b0  is a globally recognized, foundational IT certification. It validates your ability to install, configure, operate, and troubleshoot routed and switched networks. The curriculum covers core networking concepts, IP routing, security fundamentals, automation, and programmability. \
\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 How CCNA Helps in a Cybersecurity Career\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 Cybersecurity relies heavily on network infrastructure. Building a secure environment requires understanding exactly how data moves across a network. Here is how CCNA powers a career in 
\f0\b Cyber Security Consulting (CSC)
\f1\b0 :\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls63\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Attack Surface Mastery:
\f1\b0  To protect a network, you must first understand its architecture. CCNA teaches you how devices (routers, switches, firewalls) communicate, exposing exactly where vulnerabilities lie. \
\ls63\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Log & Traffic Analysis:
\f1\b0  You will learn to read network traffic, which is vital for interpreting logs, identifying anomalies, and spotting indicators of compromise (IoCs).\
\pard\pardeftab560\partightenfactor0

\f3\fs18 \cf0 	\'95		\'95	
\f0\b\fs26 Foundation for Security Certifications:
\f1\b0  CCNA bridges the gap perfectly for advanced cybersecurity certs like the CompTIA Security+, CySA+, or Cisco's own CyberOps Professional. \
\
\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

