\f0\b\fs26 Binary Math:
\f1\b0  Understand how to count in binary and convert between binary, decimal, and hexadecimal (essential for IP addressing).\
\ls64\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Basic Hardware:
\f1\b0  Know the physical differences between a Hub, Switch, and Router.\
\ls64\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 The OSI Model:
\f1\b0  Memorize the 7 layers of the OSI model and the protocols associated with each (e.g., TCP, UDP, IP). [\
